      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This fix appears to have gone live in today's patch so I wanted to post this behavior that a friend on Quest recorded:\n\nhttps://streamable.com/dewu9l\n\nThis is an improvement compared to the previous behavior since Quest users can now see what they're typing, but to mirror the behavior on PC the focus should already be at the end (including whitespace) instead of when the user begins to type.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
