  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-05-22T18:19:50.222Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On the Quest platform, when clicking on a pre-filled VRCUrlInputField, the focus is set to the beginning of the URL. This behavior is inconsistent with the PC/PCVR version, where the focus is correctly set to the end of the string, allowing normal and more convenient typing behavior.\n\nVideo of the issue:\n\n- https://youtu.be/gSU8lyfVZMc\n\nMight be related to:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1400-wrong-cursor-position-when-clicking-on-pre-filled-url-input-field",
